# api-exam-module

Build the module and its section/paper tree only.

Both Bangla and English are required for the module title, the module description, and every section and paper title. Nodes have titles only.

The tree accepts `SECTION` and `PAPER` only. A paper is a leaf. Reject any other type with `NODE_TYPE_REJECTED`.

`EXAM_PRICE` and `EXAM_DELETE` are Master Admin only. A System Admin price, archive, or delete returns `403`.

Do not add questions, components, an access mode, a course id, or a student catalog route in this stage.
